{"id": 2433, "title": "I`m thirsty", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK1"], "slug": "im-thirsty", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/2433_im-thirsty.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["妈妈：你怎么啦？", "孩子：妈妈，我累了……口也很渴。", "妈妈：坐在这儿吧。你现在怎么样？", "孩子：好一点。", "妈妈：看！那有可乐！我去买。", "妈妈：给你喝！", "孩子：谢谢，妈妈。真好喝。", "妈妈：你现在好了吗？", "孩子：是的，现在好了，谢谢妈妈！"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["媽媽：你怎麼啦？", "孩子：媽媽，我累了……口也很渴。", "媽媽：坐在這兒吧。你現在怎麼樣？", "孩子：好一點。", "媽媽：看！那有可樂！我去買。", "媽媽：給你喝！", "孩子：謝謝，媽媽。真好喝。", "媽媽：你現在好了嗎？", "孩子：是的，現在好了，謝謝媽媽！"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["mā ma： nǐ zěn me la？", "hái zi： mā ma， wǒ lèi le …… kǒu yě hěn kě。", "mā ma： zuò zài zhè r ba。 nǐ xiàn zài zěn me yàng？", "hái zi： hǎo yī diǎn。", "mā ma： kàn！ nà yǒu kě lè！ wǒ qù mǎi。", "mā ma： gěi nǐ hē！", "hái zi： xiè xie， mā ma。 zhēn hǎo hē。", "mā ma： nǐ xiàn zài hǎo le ma？", "hái zi： shì de， xiàn zài hǎo le， xiè xie mā ma！"], "english_paragraphs": ["Mom: What’s wrong?", "Child: Mom, I’m tired… and I’m really thirsty, too.", "Mom: Sit here. How do you feel now?", "Child: A little better.", "Mom: Look! There’s some cola over there! I’ll go buy some.", "Mom: Here, have a drink!", "Child: Thanks, Mom. It tastes great.", "Mom: Do you feel better now?", "Child: Yes, I feel better now. Thanks, Mom!"], "english_full": "Mom: What’s wrong?\n\nChild: Mom, I’m tired… and I’m really thirsty, too.\n\nMom: Sit here. How do you feel now?\n\nChild: A little better.\n\nMom: Look! There’s some cola over there! I’ll go buy some.\n\nMom: Here, have a drink!\n\nChild: Thanks, Mom. It tastes great.\n\nMom: Do you feel better now?\n\nChild: Yes, I feel better now. Thanks, Mom!", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"mā ma\" data-defn=\"mama / mommy / mother\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>mā ma</rt></ruby>：<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǐ\" data-defn=\"you\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zěn me\" data-defn=